{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prison Escape Simulator is a single-player Parkour , Escape and Survival game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run, Kill, Hide, Find the Right Path and Escape from the Island</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Story of the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The prisoner will be executed. His only remedy is to escape from prison.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everything is in your hands. Survive and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you escape from prison?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The survival-themed escape game will take your breath away.\u00a0Experience an action adventure with limitless play. Explore the mysterious island. And find your escape route.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>Exciting Parkour</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the downward parkour. Show your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507120/extras/parkur.gif?t=1751582839\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Escape the maze</strong> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find a way to escape the maze.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507120/extras/lab.gif?t=1751582839\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Learn to use a helicopter, parachute, and boat.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507120/extras/parasut.gif?t=1751582839\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A Unique Experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the joy of descending from the mountain, examine security cameras, let yourself go with the flow of the story, fight with different weapons and survive. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Experience a different experience with unlimited different game endings, unlimited different escape routes every time you try. Add to your wishlist to be the first to experience the unique game type</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3507120?t=1751582839","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507120/61ae08f78ede7ac022cba26ea60d2347359f5999/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751582839","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507120/5b7d4acc89087009ddb3ca4154aeaef4f184b085/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751582839","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507120/5b7d4acc89087009ddb3ca4154aeaef4f184b085/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751582839","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"HDR available","id":61},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prison Escape Simulator is a single-player Parkour , Escape and Survival game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Run, Kill, Hide, Find the Right Path and Escape from the Island</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Story of the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The prisoner will be executed. His only remedy is to escape from prison.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Everything is in your hands. Survive and escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you escape from prison?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The survival-themed escape game will take your breath away.\u00a0Experience an action adventure with limitless play. Explore the 